libexecstream
------------------------------------------
libexecstream is a C++ library that allows you to run a child process and have
its input, output and error available as standard C++ streams.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libexecstream-devel-0.3-1bl2
  libexecstream0-0.3-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://libexecstream.sourceforge.net/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/libexecstream/libexecstream-0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libexecstream-0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libexecstream-0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libexecstream-0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexecstream-0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexecstream0-0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexecstream-devel-0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libexecstream)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libexecstream.README
  /usr/share/doc/libexecstream/README
  /usr/share/doc/libexecstream/license.html

(libexecstream0)
  /usr/bin/cygexecstream-0.dll

(libexecstream-devel)
  /usr/include/exec-stream.h
  /usr/lib/libexecstream.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libexecstream.pc

